      faqTitle: "Questions buyers ask about white-label",
      q1: "Can I set my own brand colours on the check-in page?",
      a1: "No. The check-in page uses one platform-wide colour theme, the same for every warehouse, and there is no per-organisation colour picker. Your brand colour reaches the page through the two images you control: the logo at the top and the cover photo behind it. Everything else — name, address, contact, hours, domain — is yours to set.",
