      a2: "No. Only the fixed wording is translated — \"What to do\", \"Please come to the office\", \"Go to parking\" — into twelve languages, picked by the driver's own language choice. Anything you type yourself, including ramp instructions, arrives exactly as written. With mixed fleets, the action type and the card colour carry the meaning on their own.",
