      probEyebrow: "Why location detection",
      probTitle: "What problem does it solve?",
      probP1: "A driver pulls into an industrial park at 05:40. Six warehouses share the same access road, the QR sticker on the gate is behind a parked trailer, and the transport order names a company, not a check-in page. He scrolls a list on his phone, picks the one that sounds right, and checks in at the neighbour's yard. The operator now has a phantom truck and the driver is still outside the gate.",
