      a2: "Yes. The number is how the system reaches him: he types it on the tablet, confirms it with the code sent by SMS, and every instruction after that — ramp 12, please wait — arrives there. QRGO Self removes the need for a smartphone, not the need for a phone. Any handset that receives SMS is enough.",
