      ui2fa: "2FA · TOTP or SMS",
      mxTitle: "What each role can do",
      mxSub: "Taken from the rules the product actually enforces. Warehouse manager and professional carry the same rights; a dispatcher's departments are what unlock the rest.",
      mxRole1: "Warehouse manager",
      mxRole2: "Professional",
      mxRole3: "Dispatcher + departments",
