      probEyebrow: "Why analytics",
      probTitle: "What problem does it solve?",
      probP1: "Without numbers, a warehouse runs on gut feeling. Nobody can say how long trucks really wait, which hours are the busiest, how full the docks are, or whether last month beat this one — so bottlenecks stay invisible and there is nothing to show head office.",
      probP2: "Logistiq turns every check-in into data. Wait time, processing time, throughput and dock utilisation are computed live from real timestamps and rolled up across today, the last 7 days or the last 30 — so you see where time is lost and can prove the improvement.",
      oldTitle: "Spreadsheets & guesswork",
      old1: "Nobody knows the real average wait time",
